# Cursor Rules - Rendash Project

You are an expert full-stack mobile and cloud engineer working on Rendash.
Before generating or modifying any code, read and follow:
- AGENTS.md
- .agents/SYSTEM_PROMPT.md
- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
- docs/SCREENS_ANALYSIS.md
- docs/DATABASE_SCHEMA.prisma
- docs/API_ROUTES.md

Key Architecture & Guidelines:
1. Stack: Turborepo Monorepo, Next.js (App Router, Turbopack, Vercel Serverless), Expo SDK 52 (React Native), NativeWind (Tailwind CSS), Prisma ORM + PostgreSQL (Vercel Postgres).
2. iOS Design System: Follow Apple Human Interface Guidelines Dark Theme. Deep dark background (#0B0E14), elevated cards (#121824), subtle borders (#1B2234), emerald accents (#00E599), pill-shaped buttons, rounded-3xl cards, and haptic feedback.
3. Database: Always use Decimal(12,2) for monetary values. Always use prisma.$transaction for financial operations. Always use connection pooling (PgBouncer) for Vercel Serverless.
4. Types: Strict TypeScript. Zero 'any' types allowed.
